**Layer 1 (Highest Conviction):** Semis are foundational. Named positions: Nvidia, Broadcom (AVGO), Cerebras. Power: Constellation Energy (nuclear), GE Vernova (liquid gas).

**Layer 2 (High Conviction):** Foundational models are "incredibly important." Named: OpenAI, Anthropic, Google.

**Layer 3 (Fuzziest Lens):** Applications are hard to predict — will legacy SaaS winners be helped or wiped out by AI?

